  "details": "So Vrchat has the flying camera now which is great! I think it can be better honestly. What if you added waypoints that whenever you click it the camera stays in the pose its at(Up/down/Left/Right/ etc...) in the direction its facing and follows the line you are basically making(Point 1/Point 2/Point 3 etc...) making it like a cinematic for showing off worlds or making cool videos with your friends? Alot of people make content for vrchat such as youtube/tiktok etc...I enjoy making cinematics as a hobby and I think this would be a good way to get more people into vrchat or involved with it.",
